<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Privacy Policy</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/images/favicon.svg">
</head>
<body>

  <!-- This is placeholder boilerplate, not legal advice — have this
       reviewed (and customized for your actual data practices and
       jurisdiction) before relying on it. -->
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> [Set this date]</p>
  <p><strong><%= site.businessName %></strong> Client Portal</p>

  <section>
    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We may collect information you provide such as name, email, login details, and coaching responses.</p>
    <p>We may also collect basic usage data such as IP address and device information.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>We use your information to provide coaching services, manage accounts, communicate with you, and improve the Portal.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>3. Data Sharing</h2>
    <p>
      We do not sell your personal data. We may share it only with service providers (e.g., hosting, payments)
      or if required by law.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>4. Data Security</h2>
    <p>
      We use reasonable safeguards to protect your information, but no system is 100% secure.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
    <p>
      We retain your data while your account is active or as needed for legal and operational purposes.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
    <p>
      You may request access, correction, or deletion of your data by contacting us.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>7. Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      The Portal may use cookies to maintain sessions and improve user experience.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>8. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>
      We may use third-party tools such as analytics or payment processors, each with their own privacy policies.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>9. Contact</h2>
    <p>Email: <%= site.contactEmail %></p>
  </section>

</body>
</html>